【1】禁止闭源集成 / No Closed-Source Integration

1.1 不得将本软件整体或任何部分嵌入、打包、再授权、或作为另一件以闭源方式
    对外分发或提供的产品或服务的组成部分。

    You may not embed, bundle, sublicense, or otherwise include this software,
    in whole or in part, as a component of another product or service that is
    distributed or made available in closed-source form.

1.2 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）宿主平台不在此列。在 DSH 内安装、加载、运行本软件，
    以及随 DSH 官方安装包一并预置或分发本软件，均无需任何额外授权。
    此处「DSH」仅指官方发布的原版宿主，不含任何第三方修改、换名或再分发的版本。

    The DeepSeek Harness (DSH) hosting platform does not fall within clause 1.1.
    Installing, loading, or running this software inside DSH, or shipping it
    pre-installed with an official DSH release, requires no additional permission.
    "DSH" here means only the original host as published officially, and excludes
    any third-party modified, renamed, or redistributed version.

1.3 本条只是额外限制，不构成任何商业使用的许可。任何商业使用一律须另行取得
    著作权人的书面授权（参主协议「Noncommercial Purposes」一节）。

    This clause is an additional restriction only. It grants no permission for
    commercial use. Any commercial use requires separate written permission
    from the copyright holders.

【2】署名义务 / Attribution

2.1 任何公开发布的、借助本软件产出的媒体作品（含但不限于视频、直播、图文、
    音频），须以清晰可见的方式标注出处与创作者：

        本作品使用 dsh-LittleStar-meeting（星辰会议室）
        作者：插件·2代小星辰、辰启星明

    If you publicly release any media work (including but not limited to
    videos, live streams, articles, images, or audio) that was produced with
    the aid of this software, you must give clear and visible credit as follows:

        Produced with dsh-LittleStar-meeting (星辰会议室)
        By 插件·2代小星辰 (Plugin Gen-2 Xiaoxingchen) and 辰启星明 (ChenQiXingMing)

2.2 标注在作品简介、图文正文、直播简介或该平台等效的说明位置即可，
    不要求在画面内呈现。

    Credit in the work's description, article body, stream information, or an
    equivalent disclosure field on the platform is sufficient; on-screen or
    in-frame display is not required.

2.3 本条义务不因使用结束而终止。

    This obligation does not expire.

2.4 若对外发布的是基于本软件的修改版（软件形态），须在发布仓库根目录保留
    本协议全文与原作者署名，不得移除、替换或模糊化「插件·2代小星辰、辰启星明」。
    若对外发布的是媒体作品，只适用 2.1，不要求附上本协议全文。

    If you publish a modified version of this software (in software form), you
    must retain this license and the original attribution in the root of the
    published repository, without removal, replacement, or obfuscation of
    "插件·2代小星辰、辰启星明". If what you publish is a media work, only clause
    2.1 applies, and you are not required to include this license in full.

【3】贡献授权 / Contributions

3.1 以 Pull Request、补丁或等效代码提交形式向本项目提交的贡献，视为同意
    以本协议授权，并允许著作权人另行以其他协议对外授权（含商业授权）。
    仅在 Issue 中提出想法、报告问题或参与讨论，不构成本条所称的「贡献」。

    A contribution means code submitted as a pull request, patch, or equivalent
    code change. By submitting one, you license it to the copyright holders under
    these terms, and grant the copyright holders the right to license it under
    other terms, including commercially. Posting ideas, bug reports, or discussion
    comments in issues does not constitute a contribution under this clause.

3.2 没有这一条，著作权人无法在接收外部贡献的同时提供商业授权。

    Without this clause, the copyright holders could not accept outside
    contributions and still offer commercial licenses.

【4】名称与标识 / Names and Marks

4.1 本协议不授予「星辰会议室」「dsh-LittleStar-meeting」等名称、标识及相关
    品牌元素的任何使用权 —— 包括与之近似、易致混淆的名称（例如
