    你可以如实说明「本项目基于 dsh-LittleStar-meeting」，但不得：
    (a) 以上述名称或其近似名称自称；
    (b) 使用原作者的图标、头像等标识；
    (c) 作出非事实性的作者署名（如隐瞒原作者，或自称原作者）；
    (d) 让人误以为你的版本是原作者的官方版本。

    These terms grant no right to use the names "星辰会议室" or
    "dsh-LittleStar-meeting", or related marks — including confusingly similar
    names. You may truthfully state that your work is based on
    dsh-LittleStar-meeting, but you may not: (a) call your version by those
    names or confusingly similar ones; (b) use the original author's icons or
    avatars; (c) make any non-factual attribution, such as concealing the
    original authors or claiming to be them; (d) present your version as the
    original or as an official build.

